batdoc (1.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * OCR support: raster image input (.png, .jpg, .gif, .webp, .bmp) is
    always OCR'd; new --ocr flag extends OCR to embedded DOCX/PPTX images
    and textless PDF pages.
  * Extract speaker notes from PPTX; comments, footnotes, and endnotes
    from DOCX.
  * Drop the -o short flag; image OCR renders as plain text on TTY.

 -- Damon Petta <d@disassemble.net>  Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:15:00 -0400

